From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:27:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD review completion confirmation so reviewed patch
 chats close only after user approval

No-findings reviews append a yes/no prompt to the reviewed patch-agent session and select that chat. Confirmation answers are handled locally so yes hides the closed feature from the terminal agent list, while no or later follow-up input keeps or reopens the patch chat before backend sends continue.
